  "body": "TWO SPACES. ONE ADDRESS. EXCEPTIONAL FLEXIBILITY.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully appointed dual-key residence offers something genuinely special - two self-contained living spaces within one sophisticated property, complemented by impressive sea and city views.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned at Amaia, 48 Esmonde Road, this apartment is designed around flexibility. Whether you're accommodating extended family, welcoming guests, creating a private space for adult children, working from home or exploring additional income potential, there is plenty of possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe main residence features two generous bedrooms, an elegant open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, a beautifully appointed bathroom and a spectacular balcony, creating the perfect setting to relax and enjoy the ever-changing outlook across the city and towards the sea.\r\nPrivately separated from the main residence is a fully self-contained one-bedroom apartment, complete with its own kitchen, bathroom and living area. \r\n\r\nAmaia offers more than an enviable address. Walk, cycle or public transport to easily access Auckland's CBD and the wider North Shore. And then there is Takapuna itself - the beach, cafés, restaurants, shopping, coastal walks and vibrant village atmosphere all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe apartment also has a dedicated car park. With its rare dual-key configuration, outstanding views and beautifully considered surroundings, this is far more than an apartment.\r\n\r\nCall to book a private viewing! Link to documents https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NZ4E\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWith its rare dual-key configuration, outstanding views and beautifully considered surroundings, this is far more than an apartment.",
